  "body": "Nestled in a quiet and family friendly cul-de-sac, this fantastic property on a freehold title provides multiple options - yours to land bank for the future, renovate or develop. A wide road frontage and onsite services offer flexibility and peace of mind whether you are planning to invest in your future or develop.\r\n\r\nLiveable as is, but with scope to refresh and modernise if required, it is also a fantastic option for buyers looking to renovate while they live in the home or you can rent it out until you intend to build. The solid bones and spacious layout provide the perfect foundation to work from.\r\n\r\nWith a generous 200sqm floor area, the layout is functional and family friendly, offering multiple living zones and seamless indoor-outdoor flow. The double internal access garage is complemented by additional off-street parking, making it practical for families or tenants alike.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. You are in zone for Macleans Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College which are all within easy walking distance. Those needing to commute to the city can get there via the Half Moon Bay ferry and buses and there are a number of beaches, cafes, supermarkets, shops and other amenities close at hand.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to secure a slice of blue-chip real estate in one of East Auckland's most sought-after coastal suburbs. Phone now to arrange a viewing or come to one of our scheduled open homes. All agent enquiry welcome!",
